<div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="oneColumnArticleTheme"><div id="sectionHeadingForOneColumnArticle"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Why SIPROTEC 7UM85?</span></h2></div></div></div></div></div><div class="text-start container multitextblock "><div class="row justify-content-left"><div class="col col-md-8"><p>Generators are a critical backbone of our power system and are used in power plants as well as in transmission and distribution systems. Their reliable operation is essential. </p><p>SIPROTEC 7UM85 is a modular generator protection device designed to protect generators of all sizes. It provides fast, reliable functions for comprehensive protection, as well as control, automation, and monitoring. This ensures maximum uptime, extended asset life, and safe operation in conventional and modern power systems. SIPROTEC 7UM85 protects not only the generator, but also the auxiliary system, transformer, and busbar. </p></div></div></div></div></div><div id='2ApyIJTpkczdaMc4yBgJo9' class='sitesThreeColTiles themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='three-col-tiles_2' data-ste-section-id='2ApyIJTpkczdaMc4yBgJo9'>
