<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Ensure safe, reliable and flexible operation" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Ensure safe, reliable and flexible operation  </h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>SIPROTEC 7UM85 delivers generator key protection and monitoring functions. As part of SIPROTEC&#x27;s modular concept, high flexibility in hardware adaptation and firmware configuration is guaranteed to meet your requirements. </p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Enable cybersecurity" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Enable cybersecurity  </h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Meet NERC CIP and BDEW Whitepaper cybersecurity requirements. Leverage robust cybersecurity features such as role-based access control and logging security-related events for a trustworthy operational environment. </p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="IEC 61850 communications acc. to the standard" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">IEC 61850 communications acc. to the standard</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Full IEC 61850 interoperability and process bus support allow seamless integration with existing SIPROTEC 5 devices, merging units and multivendor systems, e.g. exchange information with transformer protection or voltage control.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='5Z7r0vuCMQxw1J6KJEei8W' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_3' data-ste-section-id='5Z7r0vuCMQxw1J6KJEei8W'><is-land on:visible><div id="comp-5Z7r0vuCMQxw1J6KJEei8W" class="CardsContainer" data-component-type="CardsContainer"><section id="5Z7r0vuCMQxw1J6KJEei8W" class="cards-defaultBackground" role="region" aria-labelledby="section-heading-5Z7r0vuCMQxw1J6KJEei8W"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Featured capabilities</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container"><div class="row cards-container-row"><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Wide range for protection adaptation" id="G_Wide%20range%20for%20protection%20adaptation-0" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Wide%20range%20for%20protection%20adaptation-0-title" aria-describedby="G_Wide%20range%20for%20protection%20adaptation-0-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Wide%20range%20for%20protection%20adaptation-0-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Wide range for protection adaptation</h3><div id="G_Wide%20range%20for%20protection%20adaptation-0-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Use SIPROTEC 7UM85 to protect your hydro plants in generator and motor state, your synchronous condensers in transmission or distribution systems, or your conventional power plants of all sizes.  </p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Detect ground-faults even before startup" id="G_Detect%20ground-faults%20even%20before%20startup-1" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Detect%20ground-faults%20even%20before%20startup-1-title" aria-describedby="G_Detect%20ground-faults%20even%20before%20startup-1-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Detect%20ground-faults%20even%20before%20startup-1-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Detect ground-faults even before startup</h3><div id="G_Detect%20ground-faults%20even%20before%20startup-1-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Add our auxiliary devices for rotor and stator ground-fault detection, so protection starts even before startup and prevents your generator from being started under faulty conditions.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Increase availability in hazardous areas" id="G_Increase%20availability%20in%20hazardous%20areas-2" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Increase%20availability%20in%20hazardous%20areas-2-title" aria-describedby="G_Increase%20availability%20in%20hazardous%20areas-2-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Increase%20availability%20in%20hazardous%20areas-2-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Increase availability in hazardous areas</h3><div id="G_Increase%20availability%20in%20hazardous%20areas-2-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>SIPROTEC 7UM85 features conformal coating for extreme conditions, is available with EN 60079-14 or ATEX certification for explosive environments and has SIL2 hardware and software certification for generator reverse protection. </p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-assets/1f5459c4589ce8f899743c2f1031e839981f40d9/lib/helpers/esm/index.module.js"></script><disw-hydrate component="CardsContainer" props-url="/props/5Z7r0vuCMQxw1J6KJEei8W-en-US.json" page-id="34OBB7HnuZJzH6D5CcjCk8" container="comp-5Z7r0vuCMQxw1J6KJEei8W"></disw-hydrate></template></div></is-land></div><div id='5O0pjzF0PXmuH1Qa5FvMgv' class='sitesThreeColTiles themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='three-col-tiles_4' data-ste-section-id='5O0pjzF0PXmuH1Qa5FvMgv'>
